WEBVTT

01:38.050 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

01:43.110 --> 01:43.700
[Divine Constable Tally]

01:43.700 --> 01:45.910
[Episode 7]

01:46.200 --> 01:47.000
Also,

01:48.120 --> 01:50.780
if the killer was so precise
with the poisoning,

01:51.229 --> 01:52.039
then any poison

01:52.039 --> 01:53.229
would have worked.

01:53.590 --> 01:55.070
Why choose Corpse-Dissolving Powder,

01:55.070 --> 01:56.270
which is so expensive

01:56.280 --> 01:58.200
and so easy to trace

01:58.200 --> 01:59.350
back to its source?

02:01.870 --> 02:03.000
Well,

02:03.120 --> 02:03.950
newcomer,

02:04.200 --> 02:05.760
that's a sound analysis.

02:08.750 --> 02:09.960
Greetings, Lord Constable Iron.

02:09.960 --> 02:11.400
-I am—
-Then what do you think

02:11.400 --> 02:12.310
the reason is?

02:18.400 --> 02:19.260
Only the killer

02:20.870 --> 02:22.520
knows the answer to that.

02:26.560 --> 02:27.360
Alright.

02:27.710 --> 02:28.560
Now that Corpse-Dissolving Powder

02:28.560 --> 02:29.560
has yielded no clues,

02:29.560 --> 02:30.960
let's turn our attention

02:30.960 --> 02:32.190
to the black chest.

02:33.870 --> 02:35.000
I've heard of this method

02:35.000 --> 02:36.600
of issuing murder warnings.

02:37.079 --> 02:38.480
Let's wrap things up here

02:38.520 --> 02:40.150
and head to the Tianshu Pavilion
to look for clues.

02:40.150 --> 02:40.840
All right.

02:41.910 --> 02:42.710
Lord Lou,

02:44.079 --> 02:46.340
may I go with you to the Tianshu Pavilion?

02:48.000 --> 02:48.960
Of course...

02:49.960 --> 02:50.960
not.

02:51.470 --> 02:52.280
Fall in!

02:52.280 --> 02:52.960
Let's go.

02:59.560 --> 03:00.800
Lady Constable Frost,

03:00.800 --> 03:02.750
now that Prince Wenbu's body is gone,

03:02.750 --> 03:03.710
what should we do

03:03.960 --> 03:05.420
with his bodily fluids...

03:05.870 --> 03:06.960
"The wind leaves a sound,

03:06.960 --> 03:08.360
and water leaves a trace.

03:08.360 --> 03:09.910
Anything that happens

03:10.080 --> 03:12.140
is bound to leave something behind."

03:12.800 --> 03:14.250
Those were the words of advice
and admonition

03:14.250 --> 03:14.970
from the Chief

03:14.970 --> 03:17.630
on the day
I joined the Divine Constable Bureau.

03:17.910 --> 03:19.190
But taking all this back

03:19.190 --> 03:20.230
with us

03:20.710 --> 03:22.240
is going to be quite a chore.

03:23.280 --> 03:24.240
A chore

03:24.360 --> 03:25.590
is always easier

03:25.800 --> 03:27.660
than something mentally taxing.

03:29.470 --> 03:30.310
Well said.

03:32.400 --> 03:33.710
Very well said.

03:33.960 --> 03:35.290
Then I'll leave it to you

03:35.480 --> 03:37.040
to take the body back,

03:37.160 --> 03:38.290
Trainee Constable.

03:39.190 --> 03:39.960
What?

03:40.280 --> 03:41.079
Fall in!

03:41.079 --> 03:41.800
Yes.

03:53.800 --> 03:55.530
Master was right.

03:56.530 --> 03:59.460
Why did I have to come
to the Divine Constable Bureau?

03:59.800 --> 04:02.130
Why did I have to become a constable?

04:12.000 --> 04:13.190
Wenbu, oh, Wenbu.

04:14.000 --> 04:15.980
I used to be a prince, after all.

04:16.600 --> 04:18.660
Now I'm here to collect your remains.

04:18.870 --> 04:20.600
You can't complain about that.

04:24.190 --> 04:25.600
You really stink.

04:35.370 --> 04:37.620
[Tianshu Pavilion]

04:55.190 --> 04:56.000
Found it!

05:01.190 --> 05:02.190
What did you find?

05:04.870 --> 05:06.600
A case file on murder warnings.

05:08.310 --> 05:09.190
Is there really a secret art

05:09.190 --> 05:11.320
that allows one to foresee the future?

05:11.870 --> 05:13.000
According to this record,

05:13.000 --> 05:13.920
there was once a peerless martial artist

05:13.920 --> 05:15.240
in the jianghu.

05:15.310 --> 05:16.920
Whenever he challenged someone to a duel,

05:16.920 --> 05:17.830
he would first

05:18.000 --> 05:19.920
send them a black chest
to announce the killing.

05:19.920 --> 05:21.360
He would then kill his opponent

05:21.360 --> 05:22.560
using the move depicted
inside the black chest,

05:22.560 --> 05:23.630
demonstrating

05:24.000 --> 05:25.480
his extraordinary martial prowess.

05:25.480 --> 05:26.800
If someone's martial arts mastery

05:26.800 --> 05:28.200
reaches a certain level,

05:28.390 --> 05:29.390
they may indeed be able

05:29.390 --> 05:31.590
to anticipate their opponent's moves.

05:32.390 --> 05:33.560
What was

05:33.560 --> 05:35.690
this peerless martial artist's name?

05:39.140 --> 05:41.400
[Divine Constable Bureau]
[Netherworld Swordsman Case]

05:39.720 --> 05:41.320
The Netherworld Swordsman.

05:41.680 --> 05:43.280
The Netherworld Swordsman,

05:43.510 --> 05:44.300
Dao Yin.

05:45.270 --> 05:47.159
The Netherworld Swordsman?

05:47.560 --> 05:48.950
I've never heard of him.

05:48.970 --> 05:49.890
Naturally.

05:50.560 --> 05:52.920
The Netherworld Swordsman
bathed the jianghu in blood

05:52.920 --> 05:54.560
more than thirty years ago.

05:54.830 --> 05:55.720
You and I

05:55.750 --> 05:57.390
were both still young back then.

05:57.390 --> 05:58.690
Could this Dao Yin

05:58.720 --> 06:00.380
have returned to the jianghu?

06:04.070 --> 06:05.030
Mr. Meng,

06:05.310 --> 06:06.310
what do you think?

06:07.950 --> 06:09.270
I know nothing about poison,

06:09.270 --> 06:10.070
nor do I understand

06:10.070 --> 06:11.750
the mindset of someone
who issues murder warnings.

06:11.750 --> 06:13.390
But I do understand swordsmen.

06:13.390 --> 06:14.120
If a swordsman

06:14.120 --> 06:15.480
uses poison instead of his sword,

06:15.480 --> 06:17.210
he is being untrue to the sword.

06:17.600 --> 06:19.000
And a swordsman
who is untrue to the sword

06:19.000 --> 06:21.660
can never reach the pinnacle
of swordsmanship.

06:23.750 --> 06:24.560
Wait.

06:25.160 --> 06:27.010
The Netherworld Swordsman

06:27.070 --> 06:30.120
rose to fame thirty years ago.

06:31.120 --> 06:32.150
That would make him

06:32.150 --> 06:34.070
around 70 or 80 by now, wouldn't it?

06:34.070 --> 06:35.200
It's quite possible

06:35.560 --> 06:36.900
that the Netherworld Swordsman's
successor

06:36.900 --> 06:37.790
is still alive.

06:38.950 --> 06:40.480
Do you know the name of the weapon

06:40.480 --> 06:42.810
that the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin,

06:43.190 --> 06:44.750
was

06:45.390 --> 06:46.390
famous for?

06:47.750 --> 06:48.810
What was it called?

06:49.480 --> 06:50.360
That was

06:51.159 --> 06:52.540
the Severe-Cold Sword.

07:03.480 --> 07:05.390
So his name was Dao Yin.

07:07.270 --> 07:09.470
I'd like to ask you something, Mr. Meng.

07:09.510 --> 07:11.460
What was your master's name,

07:11.560 --> 07:13.830
and where is he now?

07:19.800 --> 07:21.060
Are you suspecting me?

07:21.560 --> 07:22.390
Mr. Meng,

07:23.310 --> 07:24.510
there are some questions

07:24.510 --> 07:26.040
we need to clarify with you.

07:26.190 --> 07:29.120
Would you come with us
to the Chief Constable's Hall?

07:29.390 --> 07:30.190
Lou,

07:30.800 --> 07:32.190
Meng Rui is one of us.

07:32.390 --> 07:34.390
How could he possibly be the killer?

07:34.480 --> 07:35.720
This concerns diplomatic relations
between our two countries.

07:35.720 --> 07:36.950
Even if one of our own is involved,

07:36.950 --> 07:38.870
we have to investigate thoroughly.

07:38.870 --> 07:39.680
It's fine.

07:40.480 --> 07:42.000
The innocent have nothing to fear.

07:42.000 --> 07:43.200
Hand over your sword.

07:50.510 --> 07:51.920
I'll go with you.

07:52.950 --> 07:53.810
But I will never

07:55.170 --> 07:56.670
surrender my sword.

07:56.920 --> 07:57.720
Meng Rui.

07:58.270 --> 07:59.610
I'll say it again.

07:59.750 --> 08:01.950
As long as I live, my sword stays with me.

08:09.310 --> 08:10.640
Let's not get worked up.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.360
We're just investigating the case.

08:12.360 --> 08:14.120
We'll get to the bottom of it, all right?

08:14.120 --> 08:15.250
Under Great Shi law,

08:15.510 --> 08:17.160
a suspect must surrender their weapon.

08:17.160 --> 08:18.000
Meng Rui,

08:18.310 --> 08:19.510
surely you know that.

08:19.800 --> 08:21.730
Just because of a name like Dao Yin,

08:21.750 --> 08:23.310
you think I'm a suspect?

08:23.310 --> 08:24.910
I'm investigating the case.

08:25.750 --> 08:27.810
Do you really have something to hide?

08:29.000 --> 08:30.160
You can't put it that way.

08:30.160 --> 08:32.360
An investigation needs solid evidence.

08:32.360 --> 08:34.120
I'm only trying to get
to the bottom of this.

08:34.120 --> 08:34.909
Do you really think

08:34.909 --> 08:36.080
I'd make things difficult
for one of my own?

08:36.080 --> 08:36.270
I—

08:36.270 --> 08:37.669
I'll say it one last time.

08:37.669 --> 08:38.870
Hand over your sword.

08:51.670 --> 08:52.590
Lou,

08:52.750 --> 08:54.210
we're all on the same side.

08:54.510 --> 08:56.150
Do me a favor.

08:56.390 --> 08:57.520
Don't get worked up.

08:57.550 --> 08:58.390
Just stay calm.

08:58.390 --> 09:00.650
Why don't you hand him your sword for now?

09:06.210 --> 09:07.310
Stop arguing.

09:07.870 --> 09:08.870
The Chief is here.

09:09.790 --> 09:10.600
Chief.

09:16.480 --> 09:17.270
Meng Rui,

09:17.750 --> 09:19.030
the Divine Constable Bureau

09:19.030 --> 09:19.840
will never

09:19.840 --> 09:21.150
let a wrongdoer go free,

09:21.150 --> 09:22.370
nor will it wrong

09:22.390 --> 09:23.550
an innocent person.

09:24.000 --> 09:24.800
Do you trust me

09:25.150 --> 09:26.200
on that?

09:26.600 --> 09:28.060
I only trust the evidence.

09:31.200 --> 09:32.000
Chief,

09:32.000 --> 09:32.870
the Divine Constable Bureau has always

09:32.870 --> 09:34.550
required solid evidence
before taking someone into custody,

09:34.550 --> 09:36.950
especially when one of our own
is involved.

09:40.870 --> 09:42.630
Until the truth comes to light,

09:43.200 --> 09:45.600
you will no longer be involved
in this case.

09:46.390 --> 09:47.360
Effective today,

09:47.360 --> 09:49.080
you are to remain confined
to Winter's Haven

09:49.080 --> 09:50.320
and may not leave without permission.

09:50.320 --> 09:51.250
Any objections?

09:53.390 --> 09:54.360
None.

10:08.730 --> 10:09.630
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

10:10.390 --> 10:11.200
Mr. Meng.

10:16.860 --> 10:18.340
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

10:22.390 --> 10:24.240
Mr. Meng, forgive us.

10:26.970 --> 10:29.060
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

10:29.960 --> 10:31.160
-Mr. Meng.
-Mr. Meng.

10:32.320 --> 10:33.120
Mr. Meng?

10:36.960 --> 10:37.790
Sirs,

10:38.550 --> 10:39.600
are you

10:39.960 --> 10:41.360
monitoring Mr. Meng?

10:41.360 --> 10:42.360
Trainee Constable,

10:42.360 --> 10:44.020
don't ask too many questions.

10:48.730 --> 10:53.020
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

10:50.960 --> 10:51.720
Mr. Qi.

10:51.720 --> 10:52.390
Mr. Li.

10:56.600 --> 10:58.600
Are you bringing Mr. Meng some food?

10:58.670 --> 10:59.480
Yes.

10:59.600 --> 11:01.080
I brought him something to eat.

11:01.080 --> 11:02.550
Without the Chief's orders,

11:02.550 --> 11:03.510
Mr. Meng isn't even allowed

11:03.510 --> 11:04.970
to step outside this door.

11:11.480 --> 11:12.270
Mr. Qi,

11:12.790 --> 11:13.790
what's really going on

11:13.790 --> 11:15.240
with Mr. Meng?

11:15.390 --> 11:17.150
I don't know the details.

11:17.270 --> 11:18.630
But I heard

11:19.270 --> 11:20.600
that the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin,

11:20.600 --> 11:22.750
is connected
to the black chest murder warnings.

11:22.750 --> 11:24.950
The Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin...

11:25.270 --> 11:26.550
and the black chest murder warnings?

11:26.550 --> 11:27.630
And I also heard

11:27.870 --> 11:29.600
that the person was his master.

11:31.200 --> 11:32.510
His master?

11:33.270 --> 11:34.320
This is classified.

11:34.320 --> 11:35.650
Don't tell anyone else.

11:38.150 --> 11:39.270
I told you, Mr. Meng

11:39.270 --> 11:40.330
has a murderous aura about him.

11:40.330 --> 11:41.390
If he had nothing going on,

11:41.390 --> 11:42.720
why would he be so quiet?

11:43.150 --> 11:44.750
I heard no one at Winter's Haven

11:44.750 --> 11:46.500
has even touched his sword.

11:46.790 --> 11:48.200
If we'd known he was this kind of person,
we should have been

11:48.200 --> 11:50.360
-more cautious around him from the start.
-Mr. Qi,

11:50.360 --> 11:51.620
believe it or not,

11:51.960 --> 11:53.000
by tomorrow,

11:53.390 --> 11:54.270
this won't be

11:54.270 --> 11:55.390
a secret anymore.

11:55.960 --> 11:56.790
By then,

11:57.550 --> 11:59.000
the whole Tianhuang City

11:59.270 --> 12:00.550
might know about it.

12:18.000 --> 12:20.010
Sometimes I wonder,

12:20.150 --> 12:22.120
doesn't he get sore

12:22.390 --> 12:24.390
just sitting there without moving?

12:24.600 --> 12:25.510
Mr. Meng,

12:26.320 --> 12:27.290
I can understand

12:27.600 --> 12:29.460
how you feel

12:29.790 --> 12:31.720
about being treated as the killer.

12:32.150 --> 12:33.150
Think about it.

12:33.870 --> 12:35.480
When we first met,

12:35.910 --> 12:37.600
didn't you suspect me too?

12:37.870 --> 12:38.800
It's no big deal.

12:46.150 --> 12:47.120
Sirs,

12:47.960 --> 12:49.910
Mr. Meng isn't even a suspect yet.

12:49.960 --> 12:51.550
There's no need
to blow this out of proportion.

12:51.550 --> 12:52.600
Think about it.

12:52.720 --> 12:53.720
The killer

12:54.320 --> 12:56.240
would have to be capable

12:56.390 --> 12:58.480
of crafting one of those exquisitely
intricate black chests,

12:58.480 --> 12:59.270
right?

12:59.960 --> 13:01.240
Now look at Mr. Meng.

13:01.720 --> 13:03.960
With those sword-wielding hands of his,

13:03.960 --> 13:05.000
he'd have a hard time

13:05.000 --> 13:06.790
even weaving a scabbard out
of Dragon-whisker Grass.

13:06.790 --> 13:07.750
Let alone

13:07.960 --> 13:09.820
making one of those black chests.

13:10.720 --> 13:11.960
When we investigated the case yesterday,

13:11.960 --> 13:13.150
I observed you.

13:15.270 --> 13:16.600
With your unconventional ideas

13:16.600 --> 13:18.060
and unorthodox approach,

13:18.080 --> 13:19.600
you always manage to make discoveries

13:19.600 --> 13:21.330
in the most unexpected places.

13:21.390 --> 13:23.450
Sounds good. I like what I'm hearing.

13:24.080 --> 13:26.360
If you're going to flatter me,
keep it coming.

13:26.360 --> 13:27.510
Someone like you,

13:28.120 --> 13:30.150
choosing to be
just a trainee constable...

13:30.150 --> 13:32.410
You must have some other purpose in mind.

13:33.790 --> 13:34.630
Mr. Meng,

13:36.320 --> 13:38.150
you're in trouble yourself now.

13:38.510 --> 13:40.970
Maybe you should worry more
about yourself.

13:48.480 --> 13:49.340
Think about it.

13:50.270 --> 13:51.600
A prince of Northern Kun

13:51.600 --> 13:53.810
was killed within Great Shi's borders.

13:54.030 --> 13:54.970
My guess

13:55.150 --> 13:56.790
is that someone wants to use this

13:56.790 --> 13:58.510
to provoke a war
between the two countries

13:58.510 --> 14:00.040
and make you the scapegoat.

14:01.480 --> 14:02.740
You really believe me?

14:03.390 --> 14:04.150
I do.

14:05.390 --> 14:06.960
You're upright
and straightforward by nature.

14:06.960 --> 14:08.620
You could never be the killer.

14:10.670 --> 14:12.200
You can believe in me all you want,

14:12.200 --> 14:13.600
but I still suspect you.

14:13.790 --> 14:14.870
You can have your suspicions,

14:14.870 --> 14:16.200
and I'll keep believing in you.

14:16.200 --> 14:17.000
Either way,

14:17.360 --> 14:19.420
I'll get to the bottom of this for you.

14:20.150 --> 14:21.630
No need. Please leave.

14:25.200 --> 14:26.130
Unfortunately,

14:26.650 --> 14:27.770
this is the area

14:28.320 --> 14:30.050
I'm responsible for cleaning.

14:31.300 --> 14:33.600
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

14:31.790 --> 14:32.600
All right, that's enough.

14:32.600 --> 14:34.660
Everyone, go back and get some sleep.

14:34.790 --> 14:36.080
Don't worry. With me here,

14:36.080 --> 14:37.080
he's not going anywhere.

14:37.080 --> 14:38.870
Now get back and have some sleep.

14:38.870 --> 14:39.730
Go on, go to bed.

14:39.790 --> 14:40.600
Go now! Go!

14:40.720 --> 14:41.580
Get some sleep.

14:43.120 --> 14:45.520
-Constable Frost.
-Lady Constable Frost.

14:47.150 --> 14:48.410
Lady Constable Frost.

14:49.960 --> 14:50.670
Yan,

14:50.670 --> 14:52.930
I came to bring Meng Rui something to eat.

14:58.600 --> 14:59.360
Give it to me.

14:59.360 --> 15:00.150
I'll take it

15:00.200 --> 15:01.150
inside later.

15:01.670 --> 15:03.200
Even if you gave it to him right now,

15:03.200 --> 15:04.390
he wouldn't feel like eating.

15:04.390 --> 15:09.610
[Divine Constable Bureau]

15:13.630 --> 15:14.440
Meng Rui!

15:15.510 --> 15:16.750
A life for a life!

15:17.240 --> 15:18.200
Come out!

15:19.440 --> 15:20.360
Come out!

15:22.590 --> 15:24.070
[Divine Constable Bureau]

15:23.080 --> 15:23.870
Meng Rui,

15:24.760 --> 15:25.560
did you

15:25.580 --> 15:27.250
kill Prince Wenbu

15:27.900 --> 15:30.160
to avenge the Netherworld Swordsman?

15:30.270 --> 15:31.390
Is that so?

15:31.870 --> 15:32.750
Meng Rui,

15:33.790 --> 15:35.510
you coward,

15:36.050 --> 15:38.030
will you face me in a fight to the death,

15:38.030 --> 15:39.930
as a man of the jianghu should?

15:40.360 --> 15:41.750
Two hours from now,

15:41.940 --> 15:44.760
[Divine Constable Bureau]

15:42.150 --> 15:43.320
I'll be waiting for you

15:43.320 --> 15:45.360
at Knife-Edge Ridge on Mount Dahuang.

15:45.360 --> 15:46.600
If you don't show up,

15:47.120 --> 15:48.450
all you need to do

15:49.440 --> 15:52.030
is admit that the Netherworld Swordsman
was a fraud

15:52.030 --> 15:53.320
and that the Four Divine Constables

15:53.320 --> 15:55.240
are a bunch of spineless cowards.

15:58.030 --> 15:58.750
Mr. Meng.

15:58.750 --> 15:59.480
Mr. Meng.

15:59.480 --> 15:59.910
Meng Rui!

15:59.910 --> 16:00.840
Don't act rashly.

16:00.840 --> 16:01.870
Yan Zige is trying to provoke you.

16:01.870 --> 16:03.120
Yes, if you don't go,
you can still clear things up.

16:03.120 --> 16:04.120
But if you go, you'll only make yourself
look more suspicious.

16:04.120 --> 16:05.080
Don't go, Mr. Meng.

16:05.080 --> 16:06.080
The Chief is here.

16:10.840 --> 16:11.770
-Chief.
-Chief.

16:18.550 --> 16:19.510
Could it be...

16:19.840 --> 16:20.750
Just now,

16:21.240 --> 16:22.500
the second black chest

16:22.510 --> 16:25.040
was delivered
to the Chief Constable's Hall.

16:25.440 --> 16:26.240
Chief,

16:26.360 --> 16:27.080
Meng Rui has been confined

16:27.080 --> 16:28.870
to Winter's Haven all this time.

16:28.870 --> 16:29.550
Can that show

16:29.550 --> 16:30.950
that he isn't the killer?

16:30.960 --> 16:32.720
Meng Rui was alone
at Winter's Haven.

16:32.720 --> 16:34.150
Who can vouch for him?

16:35.320 --> 16:36.550
With Meng Rui's skills,

16:36.550 --> 16:38.150
delivering a chest to my room

16:38.150 --> 16:39.960
and returning to Winter's Haven

16:40.270 --> 16:41.470
would be effortless.

16:42.960 --> 16:43.750
Open it.

16:43.750 --> 16:44.440
Yes.

17:21.920 --> 17:23.849
This is the second murder warning.

17:24.030 --> 17:25.359
Could these two figures

17:25.680 --> 17:27.349
be Meng Rui and Yan Zige?

17:30.510 --> 17:32.200
In that case, I'll go.

17:32.430 --> 17:33.350
Taking the initiative

17:33.350 --> 17:34.210
might help us make a breakthrough

17:34.210 --> 17:35.100
in the case.

17:35.240 --> 17:36.030
You can't go.

17:36.070 --> 17:36.880
Meng Rui,

17:37.270 --> 17:38.730
if you're truly innocent,

17:38.750 --> 17:39.550
going there means

17:39.550 --> 17:40.830
falling right into their trap.

17:40.830 --> 17:42.270
That's right. Listen, everyone.

17:42.270 --> 17:43.600
Yan Zige has gone quiet.

17:43.680 --> 17:44.350
He must be afraid

17:44.350 --> 17:45.510
of your Severe-Cold Sword.

17:45.510 --> 17:47.030
He got tired of shouting
and quietly went back.

17:47.030 --> 17:47.920
Ignore him.

17:48.110 --> 17:49.110
Reporting!

17:50.750 --> 17:51.550
Chief,

17:51.680 --> 17:52.550
Yan Zige of Northern Kun

17:52.550 --> 17:53.510
has abducted Qi

17:53.510 --> 17:54.920
and injured several of our men.

17:54.920 --> 17:55.750
What?

17:55.780 --> 17:58.110
He dared lay a hand on someone
from the Divine Constable Bureau?

17:58.110 --> 17:59.920
Even as an envoy of Northern Kun,

18:00.000 --> 18:00.750
he can't get away

18:00.750 --> 18:03.750
with causing trouble
at the Divine Constable Bureau!

18:07.680 --> 18:08.680
Where's Meng Rui?

18:12.480 --> 18:14.210
Qi must be rescued safely,

18:14.270 --> 18:15.200
but remember,

18:15.310 --> 18:16.470
more importantly,

18:16.540 --> 18:17.880
we must not let the second

18:17.880 --> 18:19.340
murder warning come true.

18:19.350 --> 18:20.110
-Yes.
-Yes.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.000
Move out!

18:21.110 --> 18:21.920
Let's go.

18:24.640 --> 18:25.550
Chief,

18:27.880 --> 18:29.960
may I come with you?

18:30.310 --> 18:31.350
If I don't allow it,

18:31.350 --> 18:32.550
will you stay behind?

18:34.880 --> 18:36.720
After all, you're
only an auxiliary constable,

18:36.720 --> 18:38.480
so your status
isn't appropriate for this.

18:38.480 --> 18:39.640
Change into some civilian clothes

18:39.640 --> 18:41.640
and act according to the situation.

18:42.030 --> 18:42.830
Yes.

19:02.920 --> 19:03.880
Chief,

19:03.960 --> 19:05.480
so Meng Rui

19:05.640 --> 19:07.190
killed Prince Wenbu

19:07.270 --> 19:09.350
to avenge the Netherworld Swordsman?

19:09.350 --> 19:10.680
Could it be
that the Netherworld Swordsman

19:10.680 --> 19:12.240
had a grudge against Northern Kun?

19:12.240 --> 19:13.260
Thirty years ago,

19:13.350 --> 19:16.160
the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin,
challenged all under heaven.

19:16.160 --> 19:17.440
Many martial arts masters

19:17.440 --> 19:18.830
from both Great Shi
and Northern Kun

19:18.830 --> 19:19.830
fell at his hands.

19:20.350 --> 19:21.680
His arrogance

19:21.680 --> 19:23.350
shook the courts and jianghu
of both countries.

19:23.350 --> 19:24.200
In the end,

19:24.270 --> 19:26.310
Northern Kun was forced
to join forces with Great Shi

19:26.310 --> 19:27.110
and Grand Secretary Bai

19:27.110 --> 19:28.980
to issue a kill order.

19:29.960 --> 19:31.510
Dao Yin fought
over 100 martial arts masters

19:31.510 --> 19:33.800
from both countries, one after another,

19:34.270 --> 19:36.920
as the imperial court and the jianghu
joined forces to hunt him down.

19:36.920 --> 19:37.750
That battle

19:37.980 --> 19:39.830
was a bloodbath.

20:14.880 --> 20:16.070
Thirty years ago,

20:16.750 --> 20:18.480
the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin,

20:18.480 --> 20:20.400
was surrounded by martial arts masters

20:20.400 --> 20:21.480
from Northern Kun and Great Shi

20:21.480 --> 20:23.270
right here at Knife-Edge Ridge.

20:23.270 --> 20:25.270
After three days and three nights
of fierce fighting,

20:25.270 --> 20:28.000
they finally knocked him off the cliff,

20:28.070 --> 20:29.550
and he vanished without a trace.

20:29.550 --> 20:31.070
Since he passed the Severe-Cold Sword

20:31.070 --> 20:32.240
on to you,

20:32.640 --> 20:34.500
that means he survived back then.

20:34.830 --> 20:35.680
Is he

20:36.640 --> 20:37.790
still alive now?

20:40.070 --> 20:41.400
None of your business.

20:50.110 --> 20:51.110
You're not fighting back?

20:51.110 --> 20:52.530
Yan Zige, listen to me.

20:52.750 --> 20:53.720
The second black chest murder warning

20:53.720 --> 20:54.510
has already been issued.

20:54.510 --> 20:55.350
What's depicted inside

20:55.350 --> 20:56.830
is exactly what's happening here.

20:56.830 --> 20:57.750
If I strike,

20:57.750 --> 20:59.240
I'll be falling right into their trap.

20:59.240 --> 21:00.070
Enough talk.

21:00.920 --> 21:02.790
I'll make you draw your sword.

21:11.510 --> 21:12.310
Jiang Zhan, Ding Mao,

21:12.310 --> 21:14.640
set up the Heaven's Net and Earth's Snare!

21:29.830 --> 21:30.640
Thank you.

21:51.030 --> 21:52.880
Yan Zige's every move
is aimed at killing.

21:52.880 --> 21:55.210
Meng Rui,
don't get caught up in the fight!

22:10.030 --> 22:11.310
Meng Rui, don't!

22:32.880 --> 22:33.680
How is he?

22:35.240 --> 22:36.200
He's dead.

22:38.350 --> 22:39.160
Meng Rui,

22:39.440 --> 22:40.640
what have you done?

22:40.720 --> 22:41.930
I didn't kill him.

22:42.160 --> 22:42.880
I only used 30% of my strength

22:42.880 --> 22:43.920
in that last strike.

22:43.920 --> 22:44.350
How could I have killed him

22:44.350 --> 22:45.590
with one blow?

22:49.640 --> 22:50.480
Soliders,

22:50.680 --> 22:52.030
seize the killer, Meng Rui!

22:52.030 --> 22:52.880
Lord Xiao,

22:53.030 --> 22:54.440
how can someone
from the Divine Constable Bureau

22:54.440 --> 22:55.830
be tried by the Ministry of Justice?

22:55.770 --> 22:59.360
[Xiao Ning, Vice Minister of Justice]

22:56.200 --> 22:57.310
A life for a life.

22:57.480 --> 22:58.310
Does the Divine Constable Bureau think

22:58.310 --> 22:59.920
it can disregard the laws
of the imperial court?

22:59.920 --> 23:01.320
I didn't kill him.

23:01.440 --> 23:02.920
How can you say we disregarded the law?

23:02.920 --> 23:03.720
Mr. Meng.

23:03.880 --> 23:04.720
Lord Xiao.

23:05.070 --> 23:06.400
Yan Zige held me hostage.

23:06.400 --> 23:08.060
Mr. Meng was trying to save me.

23:08.070 --> 23:09.880
I'm sorry, Mr. Meng.

23:13.030 --> 23:14.050
The Ministry of Justice
and the Divine Constable Bureau

23:14.050 --> 23:15.240
have never gotten along.

23:15.240 --> 23:17.680
They've been looking for an excuse
to cause trouble.

23:17.680 --> 23:19.200
Now that Yan Zige is dead,

23:19.310 --> 23:21.370
they've finally found their chance.

23:21.640 --> 23:23.830
If you let them take you in
just like that,

23:23.830 --> 23:25.890
don't expect to come out in one piece.

23:27.070 --> 23:28.000
Lord Xiao,

23:28.000 --> 23:30.200
the Divine Constable Bureau
has always upheld strict laws.

23:30.200 --> 23:31.790
Once the truth is established,

23:31.790 --> 23:33.270
if Meng Rui did kill someone,

23:33.270 --> 23:34.160
I will personally

23:34.160 --> 23:35.640
hand him over to the Ministry of Justice
for punishment.

23:35.640 --> 23:37.200
Meng Rui killed a man

23:37.200 --> 23:38.030
in full view of everyone.

23:38.030 --> 23:39.030
That's the truth.

23:39.030 --> 23:39.830
Meng Rui,

23:39.920 --> 23:41.310
surrender your sword

23:41.310 --> 23:42.240
and submit to arrest at once.

23:42.240 --> 23:43.890
If you resist arrest
with your martial arts...

23:43.890 --> 23:45.620
Sever the tendons in his hands.

23:46.880 --> 23:47.920
The interrogation hasn't even begun,

23:47.920 --> 23:49.000
and the evidence isn't conclusive.

23:49.000 --> 23:50.110
How can you resort to torture?

23:50.110 --> 23:51.960
Who among you dares lay a hand on him?

23:51.960 --> 23:52.750
Yan Cheng.

24:00.440 --> 24:01.700
Why are you still here?

24:03.880 --> 24:04.680
Go!

24:08.680 --> 24:09.480
Seize him!

24:10.080 --> 24:12.190
Meng Rui, how dare you escape!

24:41.400 --> 24:44.000
How dare you aid and abet the escape
of a prisoner!

24:44.000 --> 24:44.790
My Lord,

24:46.000 --> 24:49.200
this Thousand-Mechanism Formation
requires great precision.

24:49.200 --> 24:50.110
Keep

24:50.110 --> 24:51.560
yelling at me,

24:51.830 --> 24:53.350
and I might make a mistake.

25:03.660 --> 25:07.180
[Sucheng, Border of the Great Shi]

25:09.790 --> 25:10.650
Your Highness.

25:11.750 --> 25:12.680
Third Prince,

25:12.720 --> 25:13.680
we're outnumbered.

25:13.680 --> 25:14.740
We should retreat.

25:18.030 --> 25:19.070
If Sucheng falls,

25:19.770 --> 25:25.230
[Zhou Zhu, Prince Ping,
Third Prince of the Great Shi]

25:20.270 --> 25:22.720
there will be no stronghold left
on Great Shi's northern frontier.

25:22.720 --> 25:23.720
Tianhuang City

25:24.180 --> 25:25.510
will be in grave danger.

25:25.620 --> 25:27.570
[Great Shi]

25:25.680 --> 25:26.550
Soldiers,

25:26.880 --> 25:28.070
defend Sucheng.

25:28.590 --> 25:29.830
We swear to fight
to the death and never retreat!

25:29.830 --> 25:31.680
We swear to fight
to the death and never retreat!

25:31.680 --> 25:34.340
We swear to fight
to the death and never retreat!

25:46.310 --> 25:49.070
Even if we seek peace now,
I'm afraid it's too late.

25:49.070 --> 25:51.070
It seems this won't end peacefully.

25:56.110 --> 25:56.920
Your Majesty,

25:58.310 --> 26:00.570
Northern Kun has been attacking Sucheng

26:00.720 --> 26:02.830
for three days straight
over Wenbu's death.

26:02.830 --> 26:04.310
Prince Ping may be a formidable warrior,

26:04.310 --> 26:05.680
but the enemy outnumbers our forces

26:05.680 --> 26:07.030
several times over.

26:07.030 --> 26:07.750
I'm afraid

26:08.310 --> 26:09.510
Sucheng may not hold.

26:10.110 --> 26:11.830
The people of Northern Kun
have been demanding

26:11.830 --> 26:13.440
that we hand over the murderer, Meng Rui.

26:13.440 --> 26:15.270
It seems the crisis
on the northern frontier

26:15.270 --> 26:16.670
won't be resolved as long

26:16.680 --> 26:18.280
as Meng Rui remains at large.

26:18.590 --> 26:20.790
I agree with what my elder brother said.

26:21.160 --> 26:21.960
Your Majesty,

26:22.440 --> 26:23.830
I second his proposal.

26:23.920 --> 26:24.720
It's quite rare

26:24.720 --> 26:26.350
for the two of you

26:28.070 --> 26:29.270
to agree for once.

26:34.510 --> 26:36.200
I have one more matter to report.

26:36.200 --> 26:38.030
According to Xiao Ning
of the Ministry of Justice,

26:38.030 --> 26:40.270
Meng Rui had already surrendered.

26:40.270 --> 26:41.590
But Li Si,

26:41.590 --> 26:43.200
a trainee constable
of the Divine Constable Bureau,

26:43.200 --> 26:44.510
bent the law for personal reasons
and deliberately

26:44.510 --> 26:46.440
obstructed the Ministry of Justice
from taking Meng Rui into custody,

26:46.440 --> 26:47.830
allowing him to escape.

26:49.070 --> 26:51.790
I ask that Your Majesty
punish Li Si severely.

26:52.070 --> 26:52.880
Your Majesty,

26:53.070 --> 26:54.640
from what I understand,

26:54.830 --> 26:56.760
Li Si had already subdued Meng Rui.

26:57.000 --> 26:59.070
It was Xiao Ning
of the Ministry of Justice

26:59.070 --> 27:00.340
who failed to do his job

27:00.440 --> 27:01.590
and held things up,

27:01.830 --> 27:03.400
allowing Meng Rui to escape.

27:03.400 --> 27:05.070
I ask that Your Majesty
hold him accountable.

27:05.070 --> 27:06.310
Crown Prince, your words

27:06.310 --> 27:07.640
clearly suggest an attempt
to shield someone.

27:07.640 --> 27:08.880
Isn't that trainee constable Li Si

27:08.880 --> 27:09.790
one of your men?

27:09.790 --> 27:10.510
Brother,

27:10.720 --> 27:11.830
at a time like this,

27:12.030 --> 27:13.440
before His Majesty

27:13.590 --> 27:15.270
and when it comes to matters of state,

27:15.270 --> 27:16.640
why are we still talking about
what's yours and what's mine?

27:16.640 --> 27:17.440
Your Majesty,

27:17.640 --> 27:18.510
I believe

27:18.510 --> 27:19.680
our most urgent task

27:19.680 --> 27:21.270
is to capture Meng Rui
and bring him to justice.

27:21.270 --> 27:22.510
Even if Li Si is guilty,

27:22.510 --> 27:24.640
he should be allowed
to atone through meritorious service.

27:24.640 --> 27:25.900
I ask Your Majesty to decide.

27:25.900 --> 27:26.720
Your Majesty,

27:26.830 --> 27:28.480
the Divine Constable Bureau
is suspected of showing favoritism.

27:28.480 --> 27:29.400
Why not

27:29.400 --> 27:30.790
have the Ministry of Justice
handle this case entirely?

27:30.790 --> 27:31.270
Your Majesty.

27:31.270 --> 27:32.070
Enough.

27:36.070 --> 27:38.870
Issue a warrant
for Meng Rui throughout the realm.

27:39.680 --> 27:42.880
We'll bring Meng Rui in first
and deal with the rest later.

27:43.680 --> 27:44.680
Both the First Prince
and the Crown Prince

27:44.680 --> 27:45.830
have a point.

27:46.000 --> 27:46.860
How about this:

27:47.830 --> 27:49.400
the Ministry of Justice will work together
with the Divine Constable Bureau

27:49.400 --> 27:50.510
to hunt him down.

27:51.200 --> 27:52.000
For this case,

27:52.680 --> 27:53.830
the Ministry of Justice
need not be subject

27:53.830 --> 27:56.070
to the Divine Constable Bureau's
authority.

27:56.070 --> 27:57.130
Yes, Your Majesty.

28:08.070 --> 28:08.920
Strange.

28:09.070 --> 28:09.790
Yan Zige did indeed

28:09.790 --> 28:11.400
die from a ruptured heart meridian,

28:11.400 --> 28:13.680
but his ribs are completely intact.

28:16.920 --> 28:18.120
Where is Li Qingyang?

28:18.200 --> 28:19.530
Tell him to get out here.

28:22.110 --> 28:23.160
We at Star-Gathering Pavilion

28:23.160 --> 28:25.170
run a clean and lawful business.

28:25.350 --> 28:27.400
Even officials
from the Ministry of Justice

28:27.400 --> 28:29.400
can't be this overbearing.

28:29.400 --> 28:30.890
Sharp tongue.

28:31.000 --> 28:32.200
If I don't teach you a lesson...

28:32.200 --> 28:33.640
This lady is right.

28:34.790 --> 28:35.550
Lord Xiao,

28:35.550 --> 28:37.160
you represent the imperial court.

28:37.160 --> 28:38.830
You should conduct yourself properly

28:38.830 --> 28:40.000
and treat people with courtesy.

28:40.000 --> 28:41.000
Only then

28:41.020 --> 28:43.000
will the people of Great Shi respect

28:43.000 --> 28:43.830
and trust you.

28:45.310 --> 28:46.440
Yes, Your Highness.

28:46.640 --> 28:48.440
And who might this gentleman be?

28:48.830 --> 28:50.640
His Highness Prince Ding is here.

28:50.640 --> 28:52.900
Have Li Qingyang come out to receive him.

28:58.070 --> 28:58.880
Get up.

29:13.240 --> 29:16.000
I, Li Qingyang, pay my respects,
Your Highness.

29:17.200 --> 29:18.240
Why aren't you kneeling

29:18.240 --> 29:19.640
before the First Prince?

29:26.110 --> 29:27.750
The First Prince's reputation
as a wise prince

29:27.750 --> 29:29.150
is renowned far and wide.

29:29.440 --> 29:31.240
I'm so honored to meet you today

29:31.550 --> 29:33.350
that I was beside myself with joy

29:33.350 --> 29:34.680
and forgot my manners.

29:35.030 --> 29:36.200
Please forgive me.

29:37.590 --> 29:39.190
I am Li Si, a humble commoner.

29:39.310 --> 29:40.110
I pay my—

29:40.550 --> 29:42.240
Young Master Qingyang,
there's no need for such formalities.

29:42.240 --> 29:43.030
But

29:43.920 --> 29:44.720
have we

29:45.200 --> 29:46.880
met somewhere before?

29:49.030 --> 29:50.560
I have an unremarkable face

29:50.720 --> 29:52.440
and am easily mistaken for others.

29:52.440 --> 29:53.240
Perhaps

29:54.200 --> 29:56.400
Your Highness remembers incorrectly.

29:59.160 --> 30:00.220
I heard

30:00.830 --> 30:01.960
the murderer, Meng Rui,

30:01.960 --> 30:02.830
was about

30:02.830 --> 30:04.330
to be taken into custody,

30:05.110 --> 30:06.350
yet for some reason,

30:06.790 --> 30:08.510
you let him go.

30:12.550 --> 30:13.920
Your Highness,

30:15.440 --> 30:17.500
are you here to investigate the case?

30:19.240 --> 30:20.920
If you're here on official business,

30:20.920 --> 30:23.350
then as a member
of the Divine Constable Bureau,

30:23.350 --> 30:24.960
it's my duty to ask Your Highness:

30:24.960 --> 30:26.750
will our conversation today

30:27.510 --> 30:29.350
be entered into the official record?

30:29.350 --> 30:30.200
Insolent!

30:31.110 --> 30:31.970
Your Highness,

30:32.640 --> 30:34.440
Dao Yin's sword trial across the world

30:34.440 --> 30:36.160
was thirty years ago.

30:36.200 --> 30:37.640
Isn't it a bit biased

30:37.790 --> 30:39.310
to infer Meng Rui's motive for murder

30:39.310 --> 30:41.620
was to avenge his master

30:42.200 --> 30:43.920
based on a single black chest?

30:44.030 --> 30:45.880
If we're talking motive alone,

30:45.960 --> 30:47.330
no one is more suspicious

30:47.330 --> 30:49.070
than him right now.

30:50.590 --> 30:51.590
Not necessarily.

30:51.960 --> 30:54.000
With the Northern Kun army
massing at the border,

30:54.000 --> 30:55.240
the court has no choice but

30:55.240 --> 30:57.030
to send veteran ministers
and seasoned generals

30:57.030 --> 30:58.730
to defend the frontier.

30:58.920 --> 31:00.200
That means every military officer,

31:00.200 --> 31:01.000
whether stationed here

31:01.000 --> 31:02.570
in Tianhuang City

31:02.960 --> 31:04.510
or sent to the frontier

31:04.640 --> 31:06.520
to fight Northern Kun,

31:06.590 --> 31:07.350
has a chance

31:07.350 --> 31:09.070
to earn merit and advance.

31:09.240 --> 31:10.350
If we're talking motives,

31:10.350 --> 31:11.830
the Ministry of War has one too.

31:11.830 --> 31:13.360
And wouldn't Your Highness

31:13.700 --> 31:15.200
have an even stronger motive?

31:15.200 --> 31:16.000
You—

31:17.550 --> 31:18.440
The Ministry of War

31:18.440 --> 31:20.270
has long been beyond my control.

31:20.440 --> 31:21.900
How can you conclude

31:22.030 --> 31:23.440
that Meng Rui is the murderer

31:23.440 --> 31:26.350
based on motive alone?

31:32.590 --> 31:34.120
So, Young Master Qingyang,

31:34.200 --> 31:35.980
you're quite the debater.

31:36.000 --> 31:37.170
In that case,

31:37.440 --> 31:38.970
I won't keep you any longer.

31:39.830 --> 31:42.200
But let me tell you this:

31:42.200 --> 31:44.440
as a member
of the Divine Constable Bureau,

31:44.440 --> 31:46.310
I hope you uphold the law
and remain impartial.

31:46.310 --> 31:48.840
If you abuse your position
to shield someone,

31:49.240 --> 31:52.550
even the Crown Prince
won't be able to protect you.

31:54.640 --> 31:56.040
What I want to say is this:

31:57.790 --> 31:59.400
now that I have joined
the Divine Constable Bureau,

31:59.400 --> 32:00.790
I will never wrong

32:00.790 --> 32:02.720
an innocent person,

32:02.920 --> 32:03.960
nor will I ever

32:03.960 --> 32:05.620
let a single murderer go free,

32:05.640 --> 32:07.200
even if that murderer

32:08.920 --> 32:11.110
has evaded justice for years.

32:14.920 --> 32:15.720
Good.

32:17.550 --> 32:18.750
Very good.

32:21.000 --> 32:21.790
Let's go.

32:28.880 --> 32:29.680
Jin Se.

32:32.270 --> 32:33.070
Master.

32:33.110 --> 32:34.640
What the First Prince said just now

32:34.640 --> 32:36.100
reminded me of something.

32:37.030 --> 32:38.240
Seventeen years ago,

32:38.510 --> 32:39.270
the Ministry of War

32:39.270 --> 32:41.800
was indeed
under the First Prince's control.

32:42.550 --> 32:44.750
I need you to look
into something for me.

32:45.440 --> 32:47.000
Around the ninth day
of the second month

32:47.000 --> 32:48.530
of the 20th year of Hongyun,

32:48.960 --> 32:50.550
did any urgent military reports
from the Ministry of War

32:50.550 --> 32:51.610
reach the Emperor?

32:52.400 --> 32:53.640
If so,

32:54.240 --> 32:55.370
I want a complete list
of all personnel transfers

32:55.370 --> 32:56.440
and all promotions, demotions,
rewards, and punishments

32:56.440 --> 32:59.200
in the Ministry of War
before and after that period.

32:59.200 --> 33:00.000
Yes.

33:08.440 --> 33:09.500
-Master.
-Master.

33:10.830 --> 33:12.200
Everyone, leave for now.

33:12.200 --> 33:13.000
-Yes.
-Yes.

33:15.720 --> 33:17.480
This 200,000 taels in banknotes

33:17.480 --> 33:18.680
is a token of my respect

33:18.680 --> 33:19.920
for the Crown Prince.

33:19.920 --> 33:22.350
Eunuch Zhao, I'd appreciate it
if you could deliver it to His Highness.

33:22.350 --> 33:23.310
Li Qingyang,

33:24.350 --> 33:26.680
so you do still remember the Crown Prince.

33:28.720 --> 33:30.160
Meng Rui has really

33:30.920 --> 33:32.980
stirred up a hornet's nest this time.

33:33.720 --> 33:35.350
The court and Northern Kun

33:35.350 --> 33:37.750
would love nothing more than
to tear him limb from limb.

33:37.750 --> 33:38.960
And you?

33:39.480 --> 33:41.400
You went and let him escape.

33:42.000 --> 33:43.060
Do you have any idea

33:43.720 --> 33:46.830
how much trouble
you've caused the Crown Prince?

33:49.750 --> 33:52.010
That's what Xiao Ning told you, isn't it?

33:56.830 --> 33:57.590
Eunuch Zhao,

33:57.590 --> 33:59.590
Xiao Ning is the First Prince's man.

33:59.790 --> 34:01.120
How can the Crown Prince

34:01.160 --> 34:02.640
take his word for it?

34:03.480 --> 34:04.750
That day, the Ministry of Justice

34:04.750 --> 34:07.480
and the Divine Constable Bureau
were both there.

34:07.960 --> 34:09.960
Even if they had captured Meng Rui
on the spot,

34:09.960 --> 34:12.400
it wouldn't have counted
as the Crown Prince's achievement.

34:12.400 --> 34:13.190
But what if

34:13.760 --> 34:14.960
I were to bring Meng Rui

34:14.960 --> 34:15.960
back on my own?

34:17.230 --> 34:18.070
You?

34:18.960 --> 34:19.920
Are you saying

34:19.920 --> 34:21.510
you know where Meng Rui is?

34:23.000 --> 34:24.920
Forty or fifty thousand people

34:24.920 --> 34:27.320
across Tianhuang City
are looking for him.

34:28.320 --> 34:29.980
And you think you can find him?

34:34.590 --> 34:35.920
There is only one kind of person

34:35.920 --> 34:37.000
in this world

34:37.000 --> 34:38.030
whom I can't find.

34:41.360 --> 34:43.230
Someone who has lost themselves.

34:44.670 --> 34:45.580
Unless they

34:46.190 --> 34:47.360
find themselves,

34:48.150 --> 34:49.550
no one else can find them.

34:52.710 --> 34:54.170
But Meng Rui is different.

34:54.710 --> 34:56.000
He's the kind of person

34:56.020 --> 34:57.960
who would never lose his way,
no matter what.

34:57.960 --> 34:59.150
Someone like him?

35:00.000 --> 35:01.030
I'd find him

35:02.360 --> 35:04.160
even if he were reduced to ashes.

35:09.190 --> 35:11.110
Young Master Qingyang,

35:14.710 --> 35:19.230
I hope your actions prove even better
than your words.

35:25.150 --> 35:25.960
However,

35:26.710 --> 35:27.710
there's one more thing

35:27.710 --> 35:29.710
I'd like to ask your advice on.

35:31.110 --> 35:31.920
Go ahead.

35:34.510 --> 35:37.190
The Ministry of War
is in the Crown Prince's hands.

35:37.190 --> 35:39.510
With Prince Wenbu dead,
the Ministry of War stands to gain.

35:39.510 --> 35:41.150
Does the Crown Prince truly want

35:41.150 --> 35:43.150
the Divine Constable Bureau
to bring the real murderer to justice?

35:43.150 --> 35:45.150
Li Qingyang, have you lost your mind?

35:45.150 --> 35:46.710
How dare you drag
the Crown Prince into this?

35:46.710 --> 35:47.440
You—

35:49.710 --> 35:50.590
Eunuch Zhao,

35:51.150 --> 35:52.590
I didn't say anything.

35:53.280 --> 35:54.960
You're the one shouting.

35:58.150 --> 35:59.810
You nearly scared me to death.

36:00.180 --> 36:01.020
Li Qingyang,

36:01.590 --> 36:02.830
don't you dare

36:03.410 --> 36:05.300
say things like that again.

36:08.360 --> 36:09.150
Eunuch Zhao,

36:11.190 --> 36:13.250
could it be that you're not so certain

36:13.590 --> 36:15.360
about this matter either?

36:16.030 --> 36:16.990
What if

36:17.710 --> 36:19.480
I bring the real murderer back,

36:20.000 --> 36:21.960
only for it to work
against the Crown Prince?

36:21.960 --> 36:22.710
Impossible.

36:23.390 --> 36:25.760
Absolutely impossible.

36:32.040 --> 36:34.130
Whether it's the First Prince's reaction

36:34.130 --> 36:36.020
or Eunuch Zhao's,

36:36.150 --> 36:37.760
it seems Prince Wenbu's death

36:37.760 --> 36:38.440
really

36:38.440 --> 36:40.500
has nothing to do with either of them.

36:40.710 --> 36:42.670
With Northern Kun's army
bearing down on us,

36:42.670 --> 36:44.480
besides the Ministry of War
and the Ministry of Revenue,

36:44.480 --> 36:46.360
who else stands to benefit?

37:03.070 --> 37:05.550
A master like Yan Zige

37:06.020 --> 37:07.530
would surely have

37:08.110 --> 37:11.910
inner power protecting his vital points
during a fight to the death.

37:11.920 --> 37:13.450
How could Meng Rui's strike

37:13.480 --> 37:14.920
have possibly

37:14.920 --> 37:16.580
ruptured his heart meridian?

38:10.840 --> 38:11.630
Right.

38:11.960 --> 38:14.420
Meng Rui treasures that sword of his
so much.

38:14.710 --> 38:16.900
He must be making a new scabbard

38:17.280 --> 38:19.070
for the Severe-Cold Sword.
